WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.356
You are at Garden Square on your way to the office.

00:00:05.356 --> 00:00:07.564
The clock says eight fifteen.

00:00:08.214 --> 00:00:14.452
The direct tram is delayed. Is there another way to get to the office?

00:00:15.102 --> 00:00:22.481
Yes. If we change at Central, we can still reach the office by nine.

00:00:23.131 --> 00:00:28.530
So we take the purple tram first and change to the green line there?

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:37.178
Exactly. Get off at Park Street. The office is across from the stop.

00:00:37.828 --> 00:00:40.273
Where should we change?
